OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thu 1 Oct to Sat 10 Oct
OL,6,FHigher pressure and more settled
OL,7,Fconditions look likely to build across
OL,8,Facross the UK, however it remains
OL,9,Ffinely balanced whether this will
OL,10,Fbecome focused across the north or
OL,11,Fsouth. Lower pressure and interludes
OL,12,Fof more changeable weather are likely
OL,13,Fat times, but again, there are mixed
OL,14,Fsignals regarding where this is more
OL,15,Flikely. However, an overall drier
OL,16,Fperiod than average is expected, with
OL,17,Fshorter periods of rain or showers.
OL,18,FWinds are also likely to be lighter
OL,19,Fthan average overall, but shorter
OL,20,Fperiods of strong winds remain likely
OL,21,Fat this time of year, particularly
OL,22,Facross the northwest. Temperatures are
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,23,Flikely to remain warmer than average.
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
