OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sun 11 Oct to Sun 25 Oct
OL,6,FInitially, high pressure and more
OL,7,Fsettled conditions are likely to
OL,8,Fcontinue, albeit with interruptions of
OL,9,Foccasional rain and stronger winds.
OL,10,FTowards and beyond mid-October, it may
OL,11,Fturn more widely unsettled with a
OL,12,Fgreater chance of wet and windy
OL,13,Fconditions at times. Temperatures will
OL,14,Flikely be above average for the period
OL,15,Fas a whole.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
